sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as 调用方
    participant Dispatcher as dispatcher
    participant Executor as executor
    participant PackageAB as package AB
    participant Manifest as PackageCacheInfo
    participant NodeCache as node cache

    Caller->>Dispatcher: packageId + originalNodeId(V/B)
    Dispatcher->>Executor: AbAndRouteInfoReq(packageId, originalNodeId)
    Executor->>PackageAB: 查询 package AB 候选
    PackageAB-->>Executor: 各分组对应 edition
    loop 每个候选分组
        Executor->>Manifest: 读取该 edition manifest
        Executor->>Manifest: 校验 originalNodeId 是否属于该 edition
        alt 节点不存在
            Manifest-->>Executor: 空候选路由
        else 私有节点
            Executor->>NodeCache: 精确读取 nodeId + editionId
        else 公共虚拟节点
            Executor->>Manifest: V → C
            Executor->>NodeCache: 沿用 C 自身 AB 选版
        end
    end
    Executor-->>Dispatcher: 候选路由 + AB 信息 + 路由版本
    Dispatcher-->>Caller: 按 AB 结果选路；空路由抛现有异常
